OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FIt will
OL,6,Fremain mostly cloudy with outbreaks of
OL,7,Frain, occasionally heavy. Some drier
OL,8,Fspells expected through the Lothians
OL,9,Fand eastern Borders. Moderate
OL,10,Fsouthwest winds and very mild.
OL,11,
OL,12,CWednesday:FCloudy with outbreaks of
OL,13,Frain, the rain heavy at times. Drier
OL,14,Fand brighter spells developing through
OL,15,Fthe evening.
OL,16,
OL,17,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,18,FBright spells and showers, some of the
OL,19,Fshowers heavy. A more organised band
OL,20,Fof heavy and perhaps thundery rain
OL,21,Fcould cross from the west on Thursday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
